{"t":"say","text":"Prompt chain pattern: OCR extraction, pedagogical hint generation via mid-tier vision model, and teacher escalation."}
{"t":"assume","id":"channel","text":"Students upload photos via a web or chat interface"}
{"t":"assume","id":"review","text":"Teacher review is an internal notification, not external email"}
{"t":"step","id":"in","kind":"trigger","label":"Receive worksheet photo","runs":"fc","untrusted":true,"private":true,"effect":"read","why":"Entry point for student worksheet image uploads"}
{"t":"step","id":"guard","kind":"guard","label":"Screen input safety","product":"ai-guardrails","runs":"fc","effect":"read","why":"Block prompt injection or harmful content in uploaded images"}
{"t":"step","id":"extract","kind":"ai","label":"Extract worksheet text","task":"extract","ai":"qwen3.7-plus","runs":"fc","tool":"web_search_image","effect":"read","why":"Read and structure the math or text problem from the photo"}
{"t":"step","id":"hint","kind":"ai","label":"Generate pedagogical hint","task":"generate","ai":"qwen3.7-plus","runs":"agentrun","effect":"reply","why":"Provide scaffolding hints without revealing the direct answer"}
{"t":"step","id":"deliver","kind":"act","label":"Send hint to student","effect":"reply","runs":"fc","why":"Return the generated hint back to the student interface"}
{"t":"step","id":"decide","kind":"decide","label":"Evaluate student struggle","ai":"qwen3.8-flash","runs":"fc","effect":"decide","why":"Determine if the student needs human teacher intervention"}
{"t":"step","id":"flag","kind":"act","label":"Notify teacher for review","effect":"notify","runs":"fc","approval":"skip","why":"Escalate to teacher dashboard when AI hints are insufficient"}
{"t":"step","id":"end-ok","kind":"end","label":"Hint delivered successfully","runs":"customer","why":"Normal completion path after hint delivery"}
{"t":"step","id":"end-flag","kind":"end","label":"Escalated to teacher","runs":"customer","why":"Completion path after teacher notification is sent"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-in-guard","from":"in","to":"guard","kind":"next"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-guard-extract","from":"guard","to":"extract","kind":"next"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-extract-hint","from":"extract","to":"hint","kind":"next"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-hint-deliver","from":"hint","to":"deliver","kind":"next"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-deliver-decide","from":"deliver","to":"decide","kind":"next"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-decide-ok","from":"decide","to":"end-ok","kind":"branch","label":"student progressing"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-decide-flag","from":"decide","to":"flag","kind":"branch","label":"student stuck or confused"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-flag-end","from":"flag","to":"end-flag","kind":"next"}
{"t":"ask","id":"vol","text":"How many worksheet photos do you expect students to upload per day?"}
{"t":"ask","id":"success","text":"What defines a successful hint, and what is today's baseline teacher intervention rate?"}
{"t":"done","summary":"AI tutor prompt chain using qwen3.7-plus for worksheet OCR and hint generation, with a decision step to flag teachers via notification."}

{"t":"say","text":"Single agent pattern: a coding agent reviews PRs, runs sandboxed tests, filters noise, and escalates to human approval."}
{"t":"assume","id":"pr-trigger","text":"PR webhook via EventBridge triggers the workflow"}
{"t":"assume","id":"repo-access","text":"Agent accesses repo via MCP tool for git/PR APIs"}
{"t":"assume","id":"volume","text":"Under 100 pull requests per day"}
{"t":"step","id":"pr-webhook","kind":"trigger","label":"PR event trigger","product":"eventbridge","runs":"fc","untrusted":true,"effect":"read","why":"Receive pull request opened or updated events"}
{"t":"step","id":"guard","kind":"guard","label":"Screen PR payload","product":"ai-guardrails","runs":"fc","after":"pr-webhook","why":"Detect prompt injection in untrusted PR content"}
{"t":"step","id":"review-agent","kind":"agent","label":"Code review agent","task":"review","ai":"qwen3.8-max","tool":"mcp","turns":15,"runs":"agentrun","untrusted":true,"private":true,"approval":"skip","effect":"reply","why":"Analyze code diff, run tests in sandbox, filter noise, draft comments"}
{"t":"step","id":"sandbox-run","kind":"tool","label":"Run tests in sandbox","tool":"code_interpreter","on":"review-agent","effect":"read","approval":"skip","why":"Execute test suite to verify agent's own review comments"}
{"t":"step","id":"human-review","kind":"human","label":"Human reviewer approval","task":"approve","subject":"review-agent","runs":"cloudflow","after":"review-agent","approval":"required","why":"Final human gate before posting approval or comments"}
{"t":"step","id":"post-comments","kind":"act","label":"Post approved comments","product":"third-party-api","runs":"fc","after":"human-review","effect":"send","approval":"required","why":"Publish final review comments to the pull request"}
{"t":"step","id":"done-end","kind":"end","label":"Review complete","runs":"customer","after":"post-comments"}
{"t":"step","id":"reject-end","kind":"end","label":"Review rejected","runs":"customer","after":"human-review"}
{"t":"link","id":"webhook-guard","from":"pr-webhook","to":"guard"}
{"t":"link","id":"guard-agent","from":"guard","to":"review-agent"}
{"t":"link","id":"agent-human","from":"review-agent","to":"human-review"}
{"t":"link","id":"human-post","from":"human-review","to":"post-comments","kind":"branch","outcome":"approve"}
{"t":"link","id":"human-reject","from":"human-review","to":"reject-end","kind":"branch","outcome":"reject"}
{"t":"link","id":"human-edit","from":"human-review","to":"review-agent","kind":"branch","outcome":"edit"}
{"t":"link","id":"post-done","from":"post-comments","to":"done-end"}
{"t":"ask","id":"q-volume","text":"How many pull requests do you expect per day?"}
{"t":"ask","id":"q-success","text":"What outcome means success, and what is today's baseline review time?"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Coding agent workflow that reviews PRs, verifies via sandbox tests, filters noise, and requires human approval before posting."}

{"t":"say","text":"Orchestrator with workers pattern: vision and PDF extraction, policy retrieval, payout approval routing via CloudFlow."}
{"t":"assume","id":"claim-source","text":"Claims arrive as file uploads via a web or app trigger"}
{"t":"assume","id":"policy-store","text":"Policy data is stored in a relational database like RDS"}
{"t":"ask","id":"volume","text":"How many claim submissions do you expect per day?"}
{"t":"ask","id":"success","text":"What defines a successful claim payout, and what is today's baseline approval rate?"}
{"t":"step","id":"trigger","kind":"trigger","label":"Claim upload received","runs":"fc","untrusted":true,"effect":"read","why":"Entry point for uploaded claim photos and PDFs"}
{"t":"step","id":"guard","kind":"guard","label":"Screen malicious uploads","product":"ai-guardrails","runs":"fc","why":"Protect downstream models from prompt injection in files"}
{"t":"step","id":"file-type","kind":"decide","label":"Determine file type","task":"classify","ai":"qwen3.8-flash","runs":"fc","why":"Route to correct extraction worker based on media type"}
{"t":"step","id":"extract-img","kind":"ai","label":"Extract photo claim data","task":"see","ai":"qwen3.7-plus","runs":"agentrun","why":"Vision model extracts structured data from claim photos"}
{"t":"step","id":"parse-pdf","kind":"tool","label":"Parse PDF document","task":"extract","tool":"pdf_parse","runs":"agentrun","effect":"read","why":"Built-in tool extracts text content from PDF claims"}
{"t":"step","id":"extract-pdf","kind":"ai","label":"Structure PDF data","task":"extract","ai":"qwen3.8-flash","runs":"agentrun","after":"parse-pdf","why":"Small model structures raw parsed PDF text into fields"}
{"t":"step","id":"merge-data","kind":"ai","label":"Merge extracted data","task":"summarise","ai":"qwen3.8-flash","runs":"agentrun","join":"any","why":"Unifies outputs from image and PDF branches into one object"}
{"t":"step","id":"check-policy","kind":"agent","label":"Check policy rules","task":"check","ai":"qwen3.7-plus","runs":"agentrun","turns":5,"why":"Agent retrieves policy details and validates the claim"}
{"t":"step","id":"db-lookup","kind":"tool","label":"Query policy DB","tool":"mcp","on":"check-policy","effect":"read","private":true,"why":"MCP tool to fetch customer policy limits and status"}
{"t":"step","id":"route-payout","kind":"decide","label":"Route for approval","task":"plan","ai":"qwen3.8-max","runs":"agentrun","why":"Large model decides if payout needs human approval"}
{"t":"step","id":"approve","kind":"human","label":"Approve payout","task":"approve","subject":"route-payout","runs":"cloudflow","approval":"required","why":"Human review required for financial payout commitments"}
{"t":"step","id":"pay","kind":"act","label":"Execute payout","effect":"pay","product":"third-party-api","runs":"fc","approval":"skip","why":"Calls payment gateway after human approves the payout"}
{"t":"step","id":"end-paid","kind":"end","label":"Payout completed","runs":"customer","why":"Terminal state for successfully paid claims"}
{"t":"step","id":"end-denied","kind":"end","label":"Claim denied","runs":"customer","why":"Terminal state for rejected or timed-out claims"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-trigger-guard","from":"trigger","to":"guard"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-guard-type","from":"guard","to":"file-type"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-type-img","from":"file-type","to":"extract-img","kind":"branch","label":"is_image"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-type-pdf","from":"file-type","to":"parse-pdf","kind":"branch","label":"is_pdf"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-parse-pdf","from":"parse-pdf","to":"extract-pdf"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-img-merge","from":"extract-img","to":"merge-data"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-pdf-merge","from":"extract-pdf","to":"merge-data"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-merge-policy","from":"merge-data","to":"check-policy"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-policy-route","from":"check-policy","to":"route-payout"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-route-approve","from":"route-payout","to":"approve","kind":"branch","label":"needs_approval"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-route-deny","from":"route-payout","to":"end-denied","kind":"branch","label":"auto_denied"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-app-ok","from":"approve","to":"pay","kind":"branch","outcome":"approve"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-app-no","from":"approve","to":"end-denied","kind":"branch","outcome":"reject"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-app-timeout","from":"approve","to":"end-denied","kind":"branch","outcome":"timeout"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-pay-end","from":"pay","to":"end-paid"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Designed orchestrator agent workflow extracting claim data from images and PDFs, checking policies via MCP, and routing payouts for human approval."}

{"t":"say","text":"Prompt chain pattern: extract clauses, retrieve playbook, compare, draft redlines, and gate lawyer approval before finalizing."}
{"t":"assume","id":"upload-source","text":"Contracts arrive as PDF uploads via a webhook trigger.","alt":"Contracts are fetched from an OSS bucket on a schedule."}
{"t":"assume","id":"playbook-store","text":"Legal playbook is stored in Tablestore Knowledge Storage.","alt":"Legal playbook lives in a DashVector vector database."}
{"t":"step","id":"upload","kind":"trigger","label":"Contract upload","runs":"fc","untrusted":true,"effect":"read","why":"Ingest the uploaded contract file to start the workflow."}
{"t":"step","id":"parse-pdf","kind":"tool","label":"Parse contract PDF","task":"extract","tool":"pdf_parse","runs":"fc","effect":"read","untrusted":true,"why":"Convert the uploaded PDF into text for clause extraction."}
{"t":"step","id":"guard","kind":"guard","label":"Screen contract content","product":"ai-guardrails","runs":"fc","effect":"read","untrusted":true,"why":"Detect prompt injection or harmful content before processing."}
{"t":"step","id":"extract-clauses","kind":"ai","label":"Extract contract clauses","task":"extract","ai":"qwen3.7-plus","runs":"fc","why":"Identify and structure individual clauses from the contract text."}
{"t":"step","id":"embed-clauses","kind":"knowledge","label":"Embed extracted clauses","task":"retrieve","ai":"text-embedding-v4","runs":"fc","why":"Vectorize clauses to enable semantic search against the playbook."}
{"t":"step","id":"search-playbook","kind":"knowledge","label":"Search legal playbook","task":"retrieve","product":"tablestore","ai":"text-embedding-v4","runs":"fc","why":"Find relevant playbook rules and standard positions for each clause."}
{"t":"step","id":"rank-playbook","kind":"knowledge","label":"Rank playbook matches","task":"rerank","ai":"qwen3-rerank","runs":"fc","why":"Ensure only the most relevant playbook entries are used for comparison."}
{"t":"step","id":"compare","kind":"ai","label":"Compare clauses to playbook","task":"check","ai":"qwen3.8-max","runs":"fc","why":"Analyze deviations between contract clauses and playbook standards."}
{"t":"step","id":"draft-redlines","kind":"ai","label":"Draft redline suggestions","task":"generate","ai":"qwen3.7-plus","runs":"fc","why":"Generate specific redline edits based on the comparison results."}
{"t":"step","id":"lawyer-review","kind":"human","label":"Lawyer approves redlines","task":"approve","subject":"draft-redlines","runs":"cloudflow","approval":"required","why":"Legal decisions require human approval per shared policy."}
{"t":"step","id":"finalize","kind":"end","label":"Redlines approved","runs":"customer","why":"Record successful completion of the review process."}
{"t":"step","id":"rejected","kind":"end","label":"Redlines rejected","runs":"customer","why":"Record outcome if the lawyer rejects the drafted redlines."}
{"t":"link","id":"l-upload-parse","from":"upload","to":"parse-pdf"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-parse-guard","from":"parse-pdf","to":"guard"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-guard-extract","from":"guard","to":"extract-clauses"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-extract-embed","from":"extract-clauses","to":"embed-clauses"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-embed-search","from":"embed-clauses","to":"search-playbook"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-search-rank","from":"search-playbook","to":"rank-playbook"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-rank-compare","from":"rank-playbook","to":"compare"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-compare-draft","from":"compare","to":"draft-redlines"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-draft-review","from":"draft-redlines","to":"lawyer-review"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-review-final","from":"lawyer-review","to":"finalize","kind":"branch","outcome":"approve"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-review-reject","from":"lawyer-review","to":"rejected","kind":"branch","outcome":"reject"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-review-edit","from":"lawyer-review","to":"draft-redlines","kind":"branch","outcome":"edit"}
{"t":"ask","id":"volume","text":"How many contracts are uploaded for review per day?"}
{"t":"ask","id":"success","text":"What outcome defines success, and what is today's manual baseline?"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Created a contract review prompt chain extracting clauses, retrieving playbook context, comparing, drafting redlines, and requiring lawyer approval."}

{"t":"say","text":"Prompt chain pattern: OCR extraction, regulatory check, risk flagging, and human approval before customs submission."}
{"t":"assume","id":"doc-format","text":"Invoices and packing lists are uploaded as PDFs or images.","alt":"Documents arrive via email attachments or API payload."}
{"t":"assume","id":"regulations","text":"Regulations are stored in a Tablestore knowledge base.","alt":"Regulations fetched live from an external government API."}
{"t":"ask","id":"volume","text":"How many customs documents are processed per day?"}
{"t":"ask","id":"success","text":"What outcome defines success, and what is today's baseline?"}
{"t":"step","id":"upload","kind":"trigger","label":"Document upload","task":"extract","runs":"fc","untrusted":true,"private":true,"effect":"read","why":"Entry point for uploaded customs invoices and packing lists."}
{"t":"step","id":"ocr","kind":"tool","label":"Extract document text","task":"extract","tool":"pdf_parse","ai":"qwen-vl-ocr","runs":"fc","effect":"read","untrusted":true,"private":true,"why":"Parse text and tabular data from uploaded PDFs or images."}
{"t":"step","id":"parse-fields","kind":"ai","label":"Parse customs fields","task":"extract","ai":"qwen3.7-plus","runs":"fc","private":true,"why":"Structure extracted text into HS codes, values, weights and origins."}
{"t":"step","id":"retrieve-regs","kind":"knowledge","label":"Fetch regulations","task":"retrieve","product":"tablestore","ai":"text-embedding-v4","runs":"fc","why":"Retrieve destination-country compliance rules relevant to the shipment."}
{"t":"step","id":"rank-regs","kind":"knowledge","label":"Rank regulations","task":"rerank","ai":"qwen3-rerank","runs":"fc","why":"Rerank retrieved regulations by relevance to the parsed customs fields."}
{"t":"step","id":"compliance-check","kind":"ai","label":"Check compliance","task":"check","ai":"qwen3.8-max","runs":"fc","private":true,"why":"Compare parsed shipment data against ranked destination regulations."}
{"t":"step","id":"risk-flag","kind":"ai","label":"Flag risks","task":"classify","ai":"qwen3.8-flash","runs":"fc","private":true,"why":"Identify and classify compliance risks such as restricted goods or undervaluation."}
{"t":"step","id":"draft-report","kind":"ai","label":"Draft compliance report","task":"generate","ai":"qwen3.7-plus","runs":"fc","private":true,"why":"Generate a summary report with flagged risks for officer review."}
{"t":"step","id":"officer-review","kind":"human","label":"Officer approval","task":"approve","subject":"draft-report","runs":"cloudflow","approval":"required","private":true,"why":"Compliance officer reviews and approves or rejects the submission."}
{"t":"step","id":"submit","kind":"act","label":"Submit to customs","effect":"send","product":"third-party-api","runs":"fc","approval":"skip","private":true,"why":"Send approved documents to the destination customs authority system."}
{"t":"step","id":"done-submit","kind":"end","label":"Submitted successfully","runs":"customer","why":"Terminal state for approved and submitted shipments."}
{"t":"step","id":"rejected","kind":"end","label":"Rejected by officer","runs":"customer","why":"Terminal state for shipments rejected during compliance review."}
{"t":"link","id":"l-upload-ocr","from":"upload","to":"ocr"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-ocr-parse","from":"ocr","to":"parse-fields"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-parse-retrieve","from":"parse-fields","to":"retrieve-regs"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-retrieve-rank","from":"retrieve-regs","to":"rank-regs"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-rank-check","from":"rank-regs","to":"compliance-check"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-check-risk","from":"compliance-check","to":"risk-flag"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-risk-draft","from":"risk-flag","to":"draft-report"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-draft-review","from":"draft-report","to":"officer-review"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-approve-submit","from":"officer-review","to":"submit","kind":"branch","outcome":"approve"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-reject-end","from":"officer-review","to":"rejected","kind":"branch","outcome":"reject"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-edit-draft","from":"officer-review","to":"draft-report","kind":"branch","outcome":"edit"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-submit-done","from":"submit","to":"done-submit"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Designed a prompt-chain workflow for customs document parsing, regulatory checking, risk flagging, and human approval before submission."}

{"t":"say","text":"Single agent pattern: polls flight status, detects disruptions, searches rebooking options via tools, and escalates for human approval."}
{"t":"assume","id":"polling","text":"Flight status checked via periodic polling or webhook trigger"}
{"t":"assume","id":"rebook-api","text":"Rebooking uses a third-party airline API or GDS integration"}
{"t":"assume","id":"channel","text":"Approval notifications sent via existing chat or email channel"}
{"t":"step","id":"trigger","kind":"trigger","label":"Flight monitor trigger","product":"schedulerx","runs":"agentrun","why":"Periodic check for flight status changes"}
{"t":"step","id":"agent","kind":"agent","label":"Disruption handler","task":"plan","ai":"qwen3.7-plus","runs":"agentrun","turns":10,"effect":"read","untrusted":true,"why":"Orchestrates status check, disruption detection and option search"}
{"t":"step","id":"flight-tool","kind":"tool","label":"Check flight status","task":"retrieve","tool":"mcp","on":"agent","effect":"read","untrusted":true,"why":"Fetches real-time flight data from external API"}
{"t":"step","id":"search-tool","kind":"tool","label":"Search alternatives","task":"retrieve","tool":"web_search","on":"agent","effect":"read","why":"Finds alternative flights when disruption detected"}
{"t":"step","id":"guard","kind":"guard","label":"Validate proposal","product":"ai-guardrails","runs":"fc","why":"Ensures generated rebooking content is safe before approval"}
{"t":"step","id":"approve","kind":"human","label":"Approve rebooking","task":"approve","subject":"agent","runs":"cloudflow","approval":"required","why":"Human must approve any booking change or financial commitment"}
{"t":"step","id":"rebook","kind":"act","label":"Execute rebooking","effect":"pay","product":"third-party-api","runs":"fc","why":"Calls airline API to confirm the new flight booking"}
{"t":"step","id":"notify","kind":"act","label":"Notify traveler","effect":"send","product":"chatapp","runs":"fc","why":"Informs traveler of confirmed rebooking or rejection"}
{"t":"step","id":"end-ok","kind":"end","label":"Rebooked successfully","runs":"customer"}
{"t":"step","id":"end-no","kind":"end","label":"No disruption found","runs":"customer"}
{"t":"step","id":"end-reject","kind":"end","label":"Rebooking rejected","runs":"customer"}
{"t":"link","id":"trig-agent","from":"trigger","to":"agent"}
{"t":"link","id":"agent-guard","from":"agent","to":"guard","kind":"branch","label":"disruption detected"}
{"t":"link","id":"agent-end","from":"agent","to":"end-no","kind":"branch","label":"no disruption"}
{"t":"link","id":"agent-exhaust","from":"agent","to":"end-no","kind":"exhausted","outcome":"exhausted"}
{"t":"link","id":"guard-approve","from":"guard","to":"approve"}
{"t":"link","id":"appr-rebook","from":"approve","to":"rebook","kind":"branch","outcome":"approve"}
{"t":"link","id":"appr-reject","from":"approve","to":"end-reject","kind":"branch","outcome":"reject"}
{"t":"link","id":"appr-edit","from":"approve","to":"agent","kind":"branch","outcome":"edit"}
{"t":"link","id":"rebook-notify","from":"rebook","to":"notify"}
{"t":"link","id":"notify-end","from":"notify","to":"end-ok"}
{"t":"ask","id":"vol","text":"How many flights are monitored per day?"}
{"t":"ask","id":"success","text":"What defines a successful rebooking, and what is today's manual baseline time?"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Agent-based flight disruption monitor that checks status, proposes rebooking options via tools, guards output, and requires human approval before executing bookings."}

{"t":"say","text":"Prompt chain pattern: intent classification, catalog retrieval, recommendation drafting, coupon application, and human checkout approval."}
{"t":"assume","id":"catalog-store","text":"Product catalog stored in Tablestore with vector embeddings"}
{"t":"assume","id":"coupon-src","text":"Coupons fetched via internal API or third-party service"}
{"t":"assume","id":"checkout-sys","text":"Checkout executes through a third-party payment API"}
{"t":"ask","id":"volume","text":"How many shopping assistant sessions run per day?"}
{"t":"ask","id":"success","text":"What outcome defines success, and what is today's baseline conversion rate?"}
{"t":"step","id":"chat-in","kind":"trigger","label":"User chat message","runs":"fc","untrusted":true,"effect":"read","why":"Entry point for user shopping requests"}
{"t":"step","id":"guard","kind":"guard","label":"Screen user input","product":"ai-guardrails","runs":"fc","effect":"read","why":"Block prompt injection from untrusted chat input"}
{"t":"step","id":"intent","kind":"ai","label":"Classify shopping intent","task":"classify","ai":"qwen3.8-flash","runs":"fc","effect":"decide","why":"Determine if user wants browse, search or coupon help"}
{"t":"step","id":"embed","kind":"knowledge","label":"Embed query","task":"retrieve","ai":"text-embedding-v4","runs":"fc","effect":"read","why":"Vectorize the user query for catalog search"}
{"t":"step","id":"search","kind":"knowledge","label":"Search product catalog","task":"retrieve","product":"tablestore","runs":"fc","effect":"read","why":"Find matching products using vector similarity"}
{"t":"step","id":"rank","kind":"knowledge","label":"Rank products","task":"rerank","ai":"qwen3-rerank","runs":"fc","effect":"read","why":"Re-rank retrieved products by relevance to query"}
{"t":"step","id":"recommend","kind":"ai","label":"Draft recommendations","task":"generate","ai":"qwen3.7-plus","runs":"fc","effect":"reply","why":"Generate personalized product recommendation text"}
{"t":"step","id":"coupons","kind":"tool","label":"Fetch coupons","task":"retrieve","tool":"mcp","runs":"fc","effect":"read","why":"Retrieve applicable discount coupons for the cart"}
{"t":"step","id":"apply","kind":"ai","label":"Apply best coupon","task":"generate","ai":"qwen3.8-flash","runs":"fc","effect":"write","why":"Select and apply the best coupon to the order"}
{"t":"step","id":"approve","kind":"human","label":"Approve checkout","task":"approve","subject":"apply","runs":"cloudflow","approval":"required","effect":"decide","why":"Human must approve financial commitment before checkout"}
{"t":"step","id":"checkout","kind":"act","label":"Process checkout","effect":"pay","product":"third-party-api","runs":"fc","approval":"skip","why":"Execute payment after human approval"}
{"t":"step","id":"done-order","kind":"end","label":"Order completed","runs":"customer","why":"Successful checkout terminal state"}
{"t":"step","id":"cancel-order","kind":"end","label":"Checkout cancelled","runs":"customer","why":"Terminal state when approval is rejected or times out"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-chat-guard","from":"chat-in","to":"guard"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-guard-intent","from":"guard","to":"intent"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-intent-embed","from":"intent","to":"embed"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-embed-search","from":"embed","to":"search"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-search-rank","from":"search","to":"rank"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-rank-recommend","from":"rank","to":"recommend"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-rec-coupons","from":"recommend","to":"coupons"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-coupons-apply","from":"coupons","to":"apply"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-apply-approve","from":"apply","to":"approve"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-approve-checkout","from":"approve","to":"checkout","kind":"branch","outcome":"approve"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-approve-cancel","from":"approve","to":"cancel-order","kind":"branch","outcome":"reject"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-approve-timeout","from":"approve","to":"cancel-order","kind":"branch","outcome":"timeout"}
{"t":"link","id":"l-checkout-done","from":"checkout","to":"done-order"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Shopping assistant prompt chain with catalog retrieval, coupon application, and required human approval before checkout payment."}

{"t":"say","text":"Prompt chain with parallel fan-out per locale, human approval, then marketplace publish via third-party APIs."}
{"t":"assume","id":"img-src","text":"Supplier photos arrive as URLs in an OSS bucket"}
{"t":"assume","id":"mkt-api","text":"Amazon and Shopee use SP-API and Open Platform"}
{"t":"assume","id":"langs","text":"Target locales are English, Thai, Vietnamese, Malay"}
{"t":"ask","id":"volume","text":"How many supplier photo batches arrive per day?"}
{"t":"ask","id":"success","text":"What outcome defines success, and what is today's baseline?"}
