{"t":"say","text":"Prompt chain with guard, ID verification, sanctions screening, risk decision and compliance escalation for decide-effect approval."}
{"t":"assume","id":"id-source","text":"Customer IDs arrive via a web form or API webhook"}
{"t":"assume","id":"sanctions-api","text":"Sanctions list is an external third-party API service"}
